    "notes": "Windows/Linux beta60 adds bounded draft batches, compact previews, content-bound versions, recipient privacy/deduplication and exact address filtering. Exact human approvals, native draft age, send-key durability, caps and uncertain receipts remain. New operations require installed feature8; old approval versions can require fresh approval. Windows unsigned. Current Mac Intel50/ARM39 and separate plugin feeds retained. No customer installation, real sends or real-mailbox speed claim; installed/cloud and large-mailbox acceptance remain open.",
